note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note spec/omegese-om2.md section 2 lines 53-58 (#745): 64 hex literals, eight per integer type (0, 1, the type maximum,
note the sign-bit or half value, four random values), each printed in decimal by lib putu. Values and
note spellings from Wolfram (wolfram.txt, query pairs). pairs-dec.om is the decimal spelling: same bytes.
om2
